1. Optimized the "Quality Inspection Mini Game", the rewards in the middle and late stages of the game have been greatly increased, and the time for the highest rating has been adjusted from 30 seconds to 45 seconds;
2. Optimize the sorting method of the employee skill library, and change it to sort by category;
3. Appropriately increase the sales of sports cars;
4. After using the same drawing twice, the brand influence gained will decrease;
5. Added switch buttons for different market levels in the competitor interface;
6. The background color of the employees who have been assigned work during the automobile research and development process is more eye-catching.

1. Fixed the bug that caused the novice guide to freeze due to random events;
2. The text errors in the factory upgrade process are fixed;
3. Adjusted the triggering rate of mysterious calls.

1. Fixed the bug that the text position on the interface of the Technology R&D Center was displayed incorrectly when developing new drawings;
2. Reduce the cost of initial scientific and technological research and development and drawing research and development;
3. Reduce the cost of employee recruitment;
4. Optimized after-sale events;
5. Operation prompts have been added to the factory upgrade interface;
6. Added a reminder of insufficient achievement points when creating advanced characters.

1. Fix the bug that some office supplies are missing in the scene;
2. Fix the bug of low employee ability that is automatically refreshed every year in the talent market;
3. Increased initial funds for the profession of "investment manager";
4. The initial capital of simple difficulty has been increased;
5. Adjusted the algorithm of car sales ranking version;
6. The algorithm of the global market value rankings has been adjusted.
